WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.357
Unit three. My Body Systems!

2
00:00:04.326 --> 00:00:07.985
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.035 --> 00:00:11.520
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:15.298
Today we learn about My Body Systems. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:20.344
Skeleton. Say it with me. Skeleton!

6
00:00:23.848 --> 00:00:27.465
Muscle. Say it with me. Muscle!

7
00:00:30.969 --> 00:00:34.003
Heart. Say it with me. Heart!

8
00:00:37.499 --> 00:00:41.233
Lungs. Say it with me. Lungs!

9
00:00:44.725 --> 00:00:47.892
Brain. Say it with me. Brain!

10
00:00:51.395 --> 00:00:54.712
Blood. Say it with me. Blood!

11
00:00:58.213 --> 00:01:01.563
Organ. Say it with me. Organ!

12
00:01:05.046 --> 00:01:08.396
Function. Say it with me. Function!

13
00:01:11.912 --> 00:01:21.175
My skeleton and muscles help me move. My heart pumps blood, and my lungs help me breathe. My brain is an important organ that controls every function in my body.

14
00:01:21.225 --> 00:01:22.391
I can do that too!

15
00:01:23.619 --> 00:01:28.776
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:28.826 --> 00:01:29.976
Heart!

17
00:01:30.736 --> 00:01:36.011
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:36.061 --> 00:01:37.211
Organ!

19
00:01:38.104 --> 00:01:44.162
Did you know? Your body has over 600 muscles, and some of them work even when you are sleeping!

20
00:01:44.212 --> 00:01:46.351
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:47.817 --> 00:01:55.837
Think and answer. What is one body system and what does it do?

22
00:01:55.887 --> 00:01:57.037
Great answer!

23
00:01:58.238 --> 00:02:03.065
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:03.115 --> 00:02:05.749
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

